  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DOUN-KA-FA Seed Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Cereal seed production.Beneficiaries: 5 full-time employees, 30 part-time employees, 550 seed producers (150 women), plus buyers of improved seeds.Description: Dunkafa produces and distributes certified maize, millet, sorghum and rice seed. It partners with 8 seed producing cooperatives with 585 producers. Dunkafa produces base seed that it distributes for multiplication to local seed producers that Dunkafa then collects, processes and distributes to its shops and network of clients. Dunkafa plans to expand its current 150 Tons of seed produced to 270 tons in 4 years. The proposed project will increase Dunkafa&apos;s processing and distribution capabilities through construction of a storeroom, and show room, acquisition of a seed processing unit and a distribution truck.</narrative>
  </description>
